  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">CASE 1 - Community biodiversity monitoring in El Rancho y Makanate, Bolivia</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Makanate and El Rancho communities of Monte Verde&#x2019;s Indigenous Territory have begun using camera traps to collect and analyse local wildlife data on mammals and birds, in collaboration with APCOB. The initiative has sparked a newfound appreciation for the richness of local biodiversity, overturning previous perceptions. Inspired by these discoveries, the two communities are now exploring ecotourism as a sustainable development path. El Rancho is also reinforcing its protected area to conserve biodiversity.</narrative>
   </description>
   <document-link format="APPLICATION/PDF" url="https://verdensskove.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Annex-2-CASE-1-Community-biodiversity-monitoring-in-El-Rancho-y-Makanate-Bolivia-1.pdf">
